      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURNING KUNA (1) made light work of the tricky draw with a scorching early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (22.14) at this track over 381m. Expected to feature in the finish again. LENNY'S BUD (2) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey here having won two of three starts. Recorded a 2 length win (21.97) in a Novice race last time at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. CRENSHAW KING (8) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 21.90 beating Sunset Berserk. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Has definite claims. DID IT HAPPEN (7) looks an each-way chance.",
